   "text": "F3  node to node on the frontend: same leaf pair (VLAN 100 on the vPC pair) and across leaf pairs (VXLAN L2 VNI 10100)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "F3  node to node on the frontend: same leaf pair (VLAN 100 on the vPC pair) and across leaf pairs (VXLAN L2 VNI 10100)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el-0429",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 72,
   "y": 798.0,
   "width": 1608.7500000000002,
   "height": 15.625,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 6992,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6999,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "From the generated switch configs (the audit set has no east-west trace). Routed traffic of VRF k8s to and from the borders uses L3 VNI 11000; VLAN 200 / 300 exist on the control pair only; between VLANs the only path is the firewall.",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "From the generated switch configs (the audit set has no east-west trace). Routed traffic of VRF k8s to and from the borders uses L3 VNI 11000; VLAN 200 / 300 exist on the control pair only; between VLANs the only path is the firewall.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
