   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PVC traces from ctrl1 (10.1.1.11) and gpu32 (10.1.1.52). tcp 8443 and ICMP reach the firewall and are dropped there; control check: bastion > 10.1.20.18 tcp 22 is allowed (rule bastion-to-stor-mgmt).",
