   "originalText": "AI workload trace: 9 of 9 chat completions answered HTTP 200 (pc-1, pc-2 and the external network, 3 each); without the bearer key HTTP 401. The model's direct route (llm-sim.platform.lab.ai: Envoy > Service llm); F1 and F2 reach the same replicas through the inference gateway.",
